# 基础词 Unit12
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2025红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 基础词Unit12核心词汇

{{machine}}{{/məˈʃiːn}}{{n. 机器；机械}}{{The machine operates automatically.}}
{{magazine}}{{/ˌmæɡəˈziːn}}{{n. 杂志；弹仓}}{{She reads a fashion magazine every month.}}
{{magnet}}{{/ˈmæɡnət}}{{n. 磁铁；有吸引力的人或物}}{{The city is a magnet for tourists from all over the world.}}
{{magnificent}}{{/mæɡˈnɪfɪsnt}}{{adj. 壮丽的；宏伟的}}{{The palace was a magnificent example of architecture.}}
{{maintain}}{{/meɪnˈteɪn}}{{v. 维持；保养；主张}}{{It is important to maintain a healthy lifestyle.}}
{{major}}{{/ˈmeɪdʒər}}{{adj./n. 主要的；专业}}{{Education is a major concern for parents.}}
{{majority}}{{/məˈdʒɒrəti}}{{n. 多数；大多数}}{{The majority of students voted for the proposal.}}
{{manage}}{{/ˈmænɪdʒ}}{{v. 管理；设法}}{{She manages a team of 30 employees.}}
{{manifest}}{{/ˈmænɪfest}}{{v./adj. 表明；明显的}}{{His talent manifested itself at an early age.}}
{{manipulate}}{{/məˈnɪpjuleɪt}}{{v. 操纵；操作}}{{The company was accused of manipulating stock prices.}}
{{manner}}{{/ˈmænər}}{{n. 方式；礼貌}}{{She spoke in a polite manner.}}
{{manual}}{{/ˈmænjuəl}}{{adj./n. 手工的；手册}}{{Please read the instruction manual before using the device.}}
{{manufacture}}{{/ˌmænjuˈfæktʃər}}{{v./n. 制造；生产}}{{The factory manufactures electronic components.}}
{{margin}}{{/ˈmɑːdʒɪn}}{{n. 边缘；利润；余地}}{{The company operates on a narrow margin.}}
{{marine}}{{/məˈriːn}}{{adj./n. 海洋的；海军陆战队}}{{Marine pollution is a serious environmental problem.}}
{{mark}}{{/mɑːk}}{{n./v. 标记；分数；标志}}{{The teacher gave him a high mark for the essay.}}
{{market}}{{/ˈmɑːkɪt}}{{n./v. 市场；营销}}{{The stock market crashed in 2008.}}
{{mass}}{{/mæs}}{{n./adj. 大量；群众的}}{{A mass of people gathered in the square.}}
{{master}}{{/ˈmɑːstər}}{{n./v. 主人；掌握}}{{She has mastered three foreign languages.}}
{{match}}{{/mætʃ}}{{n./v. 比赛；匹配；火柴}}{{The football match ended in a draw.}}
{{mate}}{{/meɪt}}{{n. 伙伴；配偶}}{{He is my classmate and close mate.}}
{{material}}{{/məˈtɪəriəl}}{{n./adj. 材料；物质的}}{{The building is made of durable materials.}}
{{mathematics}}{{/ˌmæθəˈmætɪks}}{{n. 数学}}{{Mathematics is a fundamental subject in school.}}
{{mature}}{{/məˈtʃʊər}}{{adj./v. 成熟的；使成熟}}{{She is very mature for her age.}}
{{maximum}}{{/ˈmæksɪməm}}{{adj./n. 最大的；最大量}}{{The maximum speed on this road is 120 km/h.}}
{{meanwhile}}{{/ˈmiːnwaɪl}}{{adv. 与此同时；在此期间}}{{She was cooking; meanwhile, he was setting the table.}}
{{measure}}{{/ˈmeʒər}}{{n./v. 措施；测量}}{{The government took measures to reduce pollution.}}
{{mechanism}}{{/ˈmekənɪzəm}}{{n. 机制；机械装置}}{{The clock has a complex mechanism.}}
{{media}}{{/ˈmiːdiə}}{{n. 媒体；媒介}}{{Social media has changed the way we communicate.}}
{{medium}}{{/ˈmiːdiəm}}{{adj./n. 中等的；媒介}}{{He ordered a medium-sized coffee.}}
{{membership}}{{/ˈmembəʃɪp}}{{n. 会员资格}}{{The gym offers annual membership at a discount.}}
{{mental}}{{/ˈmentl}}{{adj. 精神的；心理的}}{{Mental health is as important as physical health.}}
{{mention}}{{/ˈmenʃn}}{{v./n. 提及；说起}}{{He mentioned the idea during the meeting.}}
{{merchant}}{{/ˈmɜːtʃənt}}{{n. 商人}}{{The merchant sold goods from all over the world.}}
{{mercy}}{{/ˈmɜːsi}}{{n. 仁慈；怜悯}}{{The judge showed mercy to the first-time offender.}}
{{mere}}{{/mɪər}}{{adj. 仅仅的；只不过的}}{{He is a mere child; don't be too hard on him.}}
{{merit}}{{/ˈmerɪt}}{{n./v. 优点；值得}}{{The plan has considerable merit.}}
{{method}}{{/ˈmeθəd}}{{n. 方法；办法}}{{We need to find a more efficient method.}}
{{migrate}}{{/maɪˈɡreɪt}}{{v. 迁移；移居}}{{Many birds migrate south in winter.}}
{{mild}}{{/maɪld}}{{adj. 温和的；轻微的}}{{The winter was mild this year.}}
{{military}}{{/ˈmɪlɪtəri}}{{adj./n. 军事的；军队}}{{The country increased its military spending.}}
{{million}}{{/ˈmɪljən}}{{n. 百万}}{{Millions of people watched the live broadcast.}}
{{mineral}}{{/ˈmɪnərəl}}{{n. 矿物；矿物质}}{{The region is rich in mineral resources.}}
{{minimum}}{{/ˈmɪnɪməm}}{{adj./n. 最小的；最低量}}{{The minimum age for voting is 18.}}
{{minister}}{{/ˈmɪnɪstər}}{{n. 部长；牧师}}{{The prime minister addressed the nation.}}
{{minor}}{{/ˈmaɪnər}}{{adj./n. 次要的；未成年人}}{{The problem is minor and can be easily fixed.}}
{{minority}}{{/maɪˈnɒrəti}}{{n. 少数；少数民族}}{{The rights of minorities should be protected.}}
{{miracle}}{{/ˈmɪrəkl}}{{n. 奇迹}}{{It was a miracle that no one was hurt in the accident.}}
{{mirror}}{{/ˈmɪrər}}{{n. 镜子；反映}}{{She looked at herself in the mirror.}}
{{mislead}}{{/ˌmɪsˈliːd}}{{v. 误导；欺骗}}{{The advertisement was designed to mislead consumers.}}
{{missile}}{{/ˈmɪsaɪl}}{{n. 导弹；投射物}}{{The country tested a long-range missile.}}
{{mission}}{{/ˈmɪʃn}}{{n. 使命；任务；代表团}}{{The mission to Mars was a great success.}}
{{mobile}}{{/ˈməʊbaɪl}}{{adj./n. 移动的；手机}}{{Mobile phones have become an essential part of daily life.}}
{{moderate}}{{/ˈmɒdərət}}{{adj./v. 适度的；缓和}}{{Moderate exercise is beneficial to health.}}
{{modern}}{{/ˈmɒdn}}{{adj. 现代的；时髦的}}{{The museum has a modern design.}}
{{modest}}{{/ˈmɒdɪst}}{{adj. 谦虚的；适度的}}{{Despite her achievements, she remains modest.}}
{{modify}}{{/ˈmɒdɪfaɪ}}{{v. 修改；改变}}{{We need to modify the plan to fit the new requirements.}}
{{monitor}}{{/ˈmɒnɪtər}}{{n./v. 监视器；监控}}{{Doctors monitor the patient's condition closely.}}
{{mood}}{{/muːd}}{{n. 心情；情绪}}{{She was in a good mood after receiving the good news.}}
{{moral}}{{/ˈmɒrəl}}{{adj./n. 道德的；寓意}}{{The story has a strong moral lesson.}}
{{moreover}}{{/mɔːrˈəʊvər}}{{adv. 此外；而且}}{{The plan is feasible; moreover, it is cost-effective.}}
{{mortgage}}{{/ˈmɔːɡɪdʒ}}{{n./v. 抵押；按揭}}{{They took out a mortgage to buy their first home.}}
{{mostly}}{{/ˈməʊstli}}{{adv. 主要地；大部分地}}{{The audience was mostly young people.}}
{{motion}}{{/ˈməʊʃn}}{{n. 运动；动作；提议}}{{The motion was approved by the committee.}}
{{motivate}}{{/ˈməʊtɪveɪt}}{{v. 激励；激发}}{{Good teachers motivate students to learn.}}
{{mount}}{{/maʊnt}}{{v./n. 攀登；增加；山}}{{They mounted the horses and rode into the valley.}}
{{mourn}}{{/mɔːn}}{{v. 哀悼；悲伤}}{{The nation mourned the death of the great leader.}}
{{multiple}}{{/ˈmʌltɪpl}}{{adj. 多重的；多个的}}{{The test has multiple-choice questions.}}
{{murder}}{{/ˈmɜːdər}}{{n./v. 谋杀}}{{The detective solved the murder case.}}
{{muscle}}{{/ˈmʌsl}}{{n. 肌肉；力量}}{{Regular exercise helps build muscle.}}
{{mutual}}{{/ˈmjuːtʃuəl}}{{adj. 相互的；共同的}}{{They have a mutual respect for each other.}}
{{mystery}}{{/ˈmɪstəri}}{{n. 神秘；谜}}{{The disappearance of the plane remains a mystery.}}
